### Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "HeavyRainWithFollowingVehicle" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :vehicle1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2 ;
    :hasEvidence :evidence1 .

:vehicle1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Yellow taxi following closely behind ego vehicle" .

:weather1 a :RainyCondition ;
    :description "Heavy rain reducing visibility" .

:evidence1 a :RollingBallIndicator ;
    :description "Water droplets on road indicating heavy rain" ;
    :indicatesPotentialRisk :risk2 .

:risk1 a :RearEndCollisionRisk ;
    :description "High risk of rear-end collision due to close following distance in heavy rain" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :WeatherRisk ;
    :description "Reduced visibility and traction due to heavy rain" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.92"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.88"^^xsd:float .
```

